rd of the votes. Curbing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculation, however, received the least support from readers.\par \par \uc2 As the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis deepens, please add your views on how to save the rupee in the comments section and vote in our poll below.\par \par \uc2 Follow India Real Time on \uc2 Twitter\uc2  @IndiaRealTime.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  For continuously updated news from The Wall Street Journal, see WSJ.com at \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://wsj.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://wsj.com}}}\uc2 \f2 . \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 16-08-13 0745GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130816e98g0008g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
