\par\par \b \uc2 Indian Rupee at New Record Low; Falls on Broad Dollar Strength\b0\par\par\uc2 By Khushita Vasant   \par \uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Juni 2013\par 05:36\par \uc2 Dow Jones Asian Equities Report\par \uc2 AER\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI--The Indian rupee weakened to a new record low against the dollar on Tuesday, in line with strength in the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against a number of Asian counterparts.\par \par \uc2 Around 0410 GMT, the dollar was valued at 58.47 rupees compared with 58.15 rupees in late Asian trade Monday.\par \par \uc2 The dollar is in favor with investors in the region, with the notable exception of Japan, following a string of better-than-expected U.S. economic data over the past few weeks. On Monday, \uc2 Standard & Poor's\uc2  revised its U.S. credit outlook to stable from negative.\par \par \uc2 India's yawning current-account gap has hit the rupee hardest among depreciating Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Oil and gold imports contributed to a deficit equivalent to 6.7% of gross domestic product in the October-December quarter.\par \par \uc2 A \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at a state-run bank in Mumbai said the dollar has been "overbought," but "there now appears room for the rupee to breathe."\par \par \uc2 Radhika Rao, an economist at DBS in Singapore said in a note that while the key trigger for the rupee's fall to a record lows has been broad dollar strength, "the domestic negative macroeconomic backdrop serves to hasten the bear-run."\par \par \uc2 Ms. Rao said she doesn't expect the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in a large way, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may help prevent a one-sided and volatile move in the exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 Write to Khushita Vasant at khushita.vasant@wsj.com [ 11-06-13 0414GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument AER0000020130611e96b00009\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
