\par\par \b \uc2 DJ  Indian Rupee Sinks to Fresh All-Time Low\b0\par\par\uc2 By Khushita Vasant   \par \uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Juni 2013\par 06:17\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Newswires English Content\par \uc2 RTNW\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2013, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI--The Indian rupee sank to a fresh all-time low against the dollar Monday, hurt by broad strength in the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Investors rushed to the dollar after the world's largest economy reported better-than-expected economic data, triggering fears that the U.S. Federal Reserve could taper its monetary stimulus sooner than expected.\par \par \uc2 U.S. employers added 175,000 jobs in May, topping economists' expectations slightly.\par \par \uc2 Around 0410 GMT, the dollar climbed as high as 57.54 rupees, a level never seen before. It was at 57.06 rupees in late Asian trade Friday.\par \par \uc2 The rupee's previous all-time low was 57.33, recorded on June 22, 2012.\par \par \uc2 It has depreciated 7% against the dollar since the start of May, in line with a decline in many Asian and international \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  as investors shift positions to reflect a stronger dollar and an increase in \uc2 U.S. Treasury\uc2  rates.\par \par \uc2 Concerns over India's gaping current-account deficit also weakened the rupee, accelerating its decline.\par \par \uc2 "The rupee, of late, has been hit more than other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Pradeep Khanna, managing director and head of \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading at the Indian unit of \uc2 HSBC PLC\uc2  in Mumbai.\par \par \uc2 "Foreign institutional investors in India have been pulling out money, mainly from the debt market."\par \par \uc2 As the market is still volatile, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers are watchful for any \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Mr. Khanna said.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  neither confirms or denies its presence in the market. It has a stated policy of stepping into \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets only to ease volatility. It doesn't defend a specific exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 Write to Khushita Vasant at khushita.vasant@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 10-06-13 0417GMT\par \par \uc2 Dokument RTNW000020130610e96a0004d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
