\par\par \b \uc2 *DJ India  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2 's Gokarn: Existing Policy Aimed at Quelling Rupee Volatility, Dampen Sharp One-Way Moves\b0\par\par\uc2 356 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 November 2012\par 12:14\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2012, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 19 Nov 2012 06:16 EDT *DJ  India RBI's Gokarn: High Current Account Deficit Stokes \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Volatility\par \par \uc2 19 Nov 2012 06:18 EDT *DJ  India RBI's Gokarn: Addressing Domestic Drivers of \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Dynamics Key to \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Movement Stabilization\par \par \uc2 19 Nov 2012 06:44 EDT DJ  \b \highlight22\uc2 India Central Bank Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  Policy Aims Also to Check Sharp Falls in Rupee - Gokarn\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par   By Sudeep Jain and Khushita Vasant \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MUMBAI--\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 India\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is ready to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets to check any sharp fall in the rupee, apart from its stated position of getting into the market to reduce exchange rate volatility, a top official said Monday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Any steep \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  fall has a tendency to fuel expectations of further depreciation, Reserve Bank of India Deputy Governor Subir Gokarn said at a conference on capital flows.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "Therefore, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  policy not only aims at quelling the excessive volatility, but also attempts to moderate speculative one-way downward movement of the India rupee," according to a presentation he made at the conference.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The rupee has fallen nearly 3% against the U.S. dollar over the past one month as global risk aversion has increased due to concerns over the approaching U.S. fiscal cliff.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The RBI doesn't say whether it \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets and publishes data on its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  transactions with a lag of more than a month.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mr. Gokarn said the drivers of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  volatility become more dominant if the current account deficit is high, as is the case with India.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The country's current account deficit, as a proportion of gross domestic product, slipped to 3.9% in the April-June period from 4.5% in the January-March quarter. But it still remains outside the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's comfort zone of 2%-3%.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mr. Gokarn said that addressing domestic drivers of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  dynamics is key to exchange rate stability.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Khushita Vasant at khushita.vasant@dowjones.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 November 19, 2012 06:44 ET (11:44 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020121119e8bj003f6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
