 year earlier, the fastest in 10 months.\par \par \uc2 Write to Khushita Vasant at khushita.vasant@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 October 31, 2012 06:25 ET (10:25 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020121031e8av002jo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
