\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE:  \highlight22\uc2 India Central Bank Intervened \highlight\uc2  Heavily in Forwards in May\b0\par\par\uc2 411 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Juli 2012\par 15:23\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 -- RBI's outstanding forwards position $10.31 billion in May vs $3.45 billion in April\par \par \uc2 -- Also sold net $485 million of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  from reserves in May\par \par \uc2 -- Concerns over liquidity may have prompted forwards \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  - analyst\par \par \uc2 (Adds analyst's comment in 10th-11th paragraphs, background)\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Sudeep Jain \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 MUMBAI--\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 India\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  heavily in May to support the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  -- mainly through forward contracts rather than selling dollars in the spot market, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  data showed Tuesday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Reserve Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 India\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's choice to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  more in the forwards market may have been prompted by concerns that selling dollars and buying rupees on the spot would exacerbate the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's shortage in the domestic banking system, said analysts.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The RBI sold a net $485 million of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  from its reserves in May, compared with $275 million in April. But, the net value of outstanding forward contracts to sell foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at a future date rose to $10.31 billion in May from $3.45 billion in April.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The latest RBI data covers the period when the Indian rupee lost almost 7% against the dollar as risk aversion emanating from Europe's sovereign debt crisis magnified concerns over India's high fiscal and current account deficits and the government's failure to boost investment.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The dollar, which it a record high of 57.33 rupees on June 22, was quoted at 55.39 rupees late Tuesday in Asia.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The RBI doesn't say whether it \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market and has a stated policy of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  only to curb volatility.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  heavily on the spot market in November and December, selling more than $15 billion over the two months to protect the rupee.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 In recent months, however, its spot \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  have become muted, while \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the forwards market has picked up since March.\f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 India\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's banking system until recently has been facing an acute shortage of cash, partly as a result of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 -market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , say analysts.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "When they \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in forwards, they are postponing the selling of dollars," said Vivek Rajpal, a strategist at Nomura India. "so the liquidity impact is also postponed."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Given that liquidity conditions are tight, forwards \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is the better approach since it is as effective as spot \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , he added.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to Sudeep Jain at sudeep.jain@dowjones.com [ 10-07-12 1323GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120710e87a0011c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
