\par\par \b \uc2 India says will unveil measures to check rupee's slide\b0\par\par\uc2 266 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 Juni 2012\par 10:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 KOLKATA, June 23 (Reuters) - India will unveil measures on Monday to arrest the slide of its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Finance Minister Pranab Mukherjee said on Saturday, a day after the rupee hit a new record low against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The partially convertible Indian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday hit a record low of 57.32 against the dollar, before the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  propped it up.\par \par \uc2 The rupee had hit its last record low at 56.55 on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 "These are no doubts signs of weakness in the Indian economy," said Mukherjee, who is expected to resign from his post soon to contest the presidential election.\par \par \uc2 "We will be able to take certain measures which will be announced on Monday, which will improve the market condition."\par \par \uc2 Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  likely sold $250-300 million dollars on Friday to rescue the Indian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Mukherjee said the government had discussed the situation with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor on Friday.\par \par \uc2 The rupee dropped a little over 3 percent against the dollar this week, its worst weekly decline in nine months, weighed down by mounting concerns over the global as well as India's economy.\par \par \uc2 Analysts say the rupee could continue to fall further in the near-term, dragged down by the momentum from the worsening global risk environment.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Sujoy Dhar; Writing by Rajesh Kumar Singh; Editing by Jeremy Laurence)\par \par \uc2 INDIA-RUPEE/FINMIN | ABX | BNX | FUN | C | D | E | M | O | U | MTL | GRO | SOF | OIL | G | RBN | SNS | SNI | RNP | DNP | PGE   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120623e86n00033\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
