\par\par \b \uc2 JP Morgan\uc2  Economist:  \highlight22\uc2 India Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Needs to Relook  \highlight22\uc2 FX Intervention \highlight\uc2  Strategy\b0\par\par\uc2 By Khushita Vasant   \par \uc2 281 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Juni 2012\par 10:38\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI--\b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  needs to have another look at the way in which it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets because its recent dollar sales haven't been able to stop the rupee's slide, a senior economist said Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a legitimate instrument, but the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't do it the right way," Jahangir Aziz, \uc2 J.P. Morgan\uc2 's senior Asia economist, told Dow Jones Newswires.\par \par \uc2 "The RBI could have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in a more strategic manner when the market was willing to accept it as a signal that the RBI is coming out and defending the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 Despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and other corrective policy steps, the rupee slumped to a series of record lows, with its worst being 56.51 against the U.S. dollar on May 31.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is suspected to have been deep in the market in recent weeks. India's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves fell for a fourth consecutive week to $288.26 billion as at May 25.\par \par \uc2 This is a sharp decline from $306.775 billion in early December.\par \par \uc2 While the reserves are still at a relatively comfortable level for now, it would be a cause for concern if the RBI's pace of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  keeps up over the next few months, said Mr. Aziz, who is also a former top adviser to \uc2 India's finance ministry\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 He thinks that the greenback's rally is overshot and that it may correct by 5% or 6% against the rupee in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Write to Khushita Vasant at khushita.vasant@dowjones.com [ 06-06-12 0839GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120606e866000jd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
